@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-10-15

Feature: Copy Share Command
  "CLI handler for mason cp: duplicate a share at a new path with a fresh slug."

  Provides:
    - cli.newCpCommand @source("symbol:newCpCommand")
    - cli.defaultCpRun @source("symbol:defaultCpRun")

  Consumes:
    - links.Service.Copy
    - cli.shareStack
    - output.WriteJSON

  Invariants:
    - Human output MUST report the new object path and both URLs
    - Quiet mode MUST print only the short URL
    - JSON output MUST use the stable cpJSON shape under output.Success

  Scenario (happy-path): Copy with human output
    Given a successful copy result
    When renderCp runs without --json
    Then stdout shows the new path and URLs

  Scenario (negative): Copy failure
    Given Copy returns an error
    When the command runs
    Then emitError renders the failure
